Subject: winecfg, user32: the Raye eye instead of the old logo

The settings icon, the picture on their About page and the default
icon for windows that have none (IDI_WINLOGO) show the Raye eye. The
pictures are the theme's raye-eye PNGs (16, 32, 48 and 256 px).
